All paths are relative to index.html; `defer` runs the script after DOM construction.

clamp(min, preferred, max) resolves the middle value while clamping the result between the bounds. With viewport units in the middle it produces fluid typography that never gets too small or too large — replacing several media queries.

```css
h1 {
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw + 1rem, 3.5rem);
}
```

